{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-skitia-electrical-grill-2511-0128","content_id":"4d4057b0-dd63-4b14-9950-632f5a98565a","description":"Product Safety Report for Skitia Electrical Grill presenting a high risk of electric shock and cuts.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"421802e1-ff05-41b2-b3f6-cca4ac7f5301","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-01-12T17:04:14+00:00","id":"421802e1-ff05-41b2-b3f6-cca4ac7f5301","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-01-12T17:04:14+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6965298ee8b93f59c3aecd1f/2511-0128-_product-safety-report-skitia-electric-grill.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Skitia Electrical Grill</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a high risk of electric shock as the plug has no facilities for a fuse.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The goods have been seized by the local authority and are awaiting destruction.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Electrical appliances and equipment - Electric Grills</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Skitia</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Model</td>\n      <td>72206.01</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>3800201390583</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Additional Identifier</td>\n      <td>BG124537141</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>Bulgaria</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>1600w black electric grill packaged in a white and blue box.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_421802e1-ff05-41b2-b3f6-cca4ac7f5301\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6965298ee8b93f59c3aecd1f/2511-0128-_product-safety-report-skitia-electric-grill.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a high risk of electric shock as the plug has no facilities for a fuse. The fuse is required to ensure the safe operation of the product under fault conditions, and its absence could lead to the plug overheating, shocking the user and/or exploding. The product also presents a risk of cuts, as it was found to have accessible sharp edges. Improvements are also required to the product marking, labelling and instructions.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the Electrical Equipment (Safety) Regulations 2016 or the Plugs &amp; Sockets etc (Safety) Regulations 1994.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The goods have been seized by the local authority and are awaiting destruction.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2511-0128</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-01-12T17:04:32Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"electrical-appliances-equipment","product_measure_type":["destruction-of-the-product"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-01-12","product_risk_level":"high"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-01-12T17:04:32+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/